DATA ATTRIBUTION

This licence covers the code in this repository only.

The dataset used is "Online Retail II", from the UCI Machine Learning Repository:
  https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/502/online+retail+ii
  Chen, D. (2019). Online Retail II. UCI Machine Learning Repository.
  Licensed CC BY 4.0.

The raw .xlsx is not redistributed here - download it from the link above.
The CSVs in data_real/ are a cleaned and re-scoped derivative of that dataset.
